{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと立候補し続けていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロザリオという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッツゴー！ポリン姫唯一の男役っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ選ばれるまでずっと立候補してたかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年沢村小坊主という男の子を演じて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以来男の子役自分にあってる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/05/3550040/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってしまったのよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今年も男役は絶対やりたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに！\n昨日選ばれましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やった〜ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈と一騎打ちだったよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よい戦いしたよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二幕に初日振りにでるんでずっと緊張してましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/05/3550040/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張りますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}